**Source:** arc42.md §5.1 Nivel 1: contenedores lógicos

**Purpose:** Shows the logical containers at level 1: the local client (React + TypeScript frontend), the backend (FastAPI, application/domain layer, PostgreSQL, Redis, local storage), the asynchronous workers (CPU and GPU), and the decoupled AI engine (detection, segmentation, identity matching, conditioning, generative models, refinement/upscaling) invoked through adapters by the GPU worker.
